      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1857 Clark opened a post office at his log cabin, marking the first official postal service in what is now Clarks Grove.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofclarksgrovemn.com/about-us/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Clarks Grove was laid out in 1890, a decade before the railroad reached the area, setting the stage for future growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
