      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clarks_Grove%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Clarks Grove Cooperative Creamery, founded in 1890 by Danish American farmers, became one of Minnesota’s first successful cooperative creameries.",
